---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Scene from '../components/Scene.astro';
import FeaturedProject from '../components/FeaturedProject.astro';
import ContactCta from '../components/ContactCta.astro';
---
<Layout title="Aerospace Engineering — Salim Youssef Najim" description="Aerospace Engineering at Khalifa University, systems thinking and student engineering work by Salim Youssef Najim.">
  <section class="page-hero section-pad"><div class="aero-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow section-index">Aerospace / Engineering</p><h1>A foundation<br/><span>for flight.</span></h1><p class="lead">I’m studying Aerospace Engineering at Khalifa University. My curiosity begins with flight and extends to the physics, energy and systems behind it.</p></div><Scene variant="lab" interactive class="aero-scene"/></div><div class="lab-caption"><p class="eyebrow">Explore the assembly / Drag to rotate</p><p class="eyebrow">Illustrative design study / Not a flight-qualified design</p></div></section>
  <section class="focus-section section-pad"><div class="section-heading reveal"><h2>From the principle<br/>to the system.</h2><p style="max-width:330px;font-size:13px">A component matters. How it works within the whole matters just as much.</p></div><div class="focus-grid"><article class="focus-item reveal"><p class="eyebrow">01 / Flight</p><svg class="schematic-mini" viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7 55 59-32-24 32H7Z" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="M12 30h30M6 37h25M8 44h13m33 18V9m-5 6 5-6 5 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".45"/></svg><h3>Form in motion.</h3><p>The relationship between an aircraft’s shape, its movement and the conditions around it.</p></article><article class="focus-item reveal"><p class="eyebrow">02 / Energy</p><svg class="schematic-mini" viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="26" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="m43 15-15 28h15l-5 22 17-31H40l3-19Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".5"/></svg><h3>Every transfer counts.</h3><p>How energy is captured, stored and moved through a system, and what is lost along the way.</p></article><article class="focus-item reveal"><p class="eyebrow">03 / Systems</p><svg class="schematic-mini" viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 12h22v22H8zM50 46h22v22H50z" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="M30 23h32v23M19 34v23h31" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".5"/><circle cx="42" cy="23" r="3" fill="currentColor"/></svg><h3>Think in connections.</h3><p>How individual choices change the behavior of the whole. Interfaces, constraints and trade-offs.</p></article></div><div class="academic-strip"><p><strong>Aerospace Engineering</strong><br/>Current academic path</p><p><strong>Khalifa University</strong><br/>Engineering foundation</p><p><strong>LUMOS</strong><br/>Student engineering & team leadership</p></div></section><FeaturedProject/><ContactCta/>
</Layout>
